        <headline>Wind Advisory issued September 26 at 1:28PM EDT until September 27 at 12:00PM EDT by NWS Albany NY</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Northeast winds 15 to 25 mph with gusts 40 to 45 mph.

* WHERE...In Massachusetts, Berkshire County. In New York, Dutchess
and Eastern Ulster Counties.

* WHEN...Until noon EDT Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Gusty winds will blow around unsecured objects. Tree
limbs could be blown down and a few power outages may result.
</description>
        <instruction>Winds this strong can make driving difficult, especially for high
profile vehicles. Use extra caution.</instruction>
